    "title": "Pa. House approves universal background checks bill, rejects two other gun control bills - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago HARRISBURG, Pa. — Lawmakers in Harrisburg took to the floor on Tuesday to vote on a trio of gun control bills that passed out of committee earlier this month. Democrats in the Pennsylvania House of Representatives successfully passed a bill that would mandate universal background checks with the help of a handful of Republicans. Two other bills — on red flag laws and ghost guns — where defeated by 101–102 votes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
